  "worked_solution": "First, we find the matrix $\\,A-\\lambda I:$\n\ufeff\ufeff\ufeff\n\n$$\nA-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}-3-\\lambda  & 2 & -1 \\\\ 5 & 2-\\lambda  & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1-\\lambda \\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe characteristic equation is $det(A-\\lambda I)=0.$ \n\nExpanding the determinant across the $3$rd row, we obtain the following:  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}-3-\\lambda  & 2 & -1 \\\\ 5 & 2-\\lambda  & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (1-\\lambda )|\\begin{aligned}-3-\\lambda  & 2 \\\\ 5 & 2-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (1-\\lambda )((-3-\\lambda )(2-\\lambda )-2\\cdot 5) & =0 \\\\ (1-\\lambda )({\\lambda }^{2}+\\lambda -16) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$",
